{"id":"349bd461911980d1","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-language-property-codes.md","title":"Nontrivial Language Property and Its Index Set","display":"df-language-property-index-set — Nontrivial Language Property and Its Index Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-language-property-codes","aliases":["73-df-language-property-codes","73-df-language-property-index-set"],"display":"df-language-property-index-set — Nontrivial Language Property and Its Index Set","depends_on":["[[73-df-binary-program-coding]]","[[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]]","[[73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-language-property-codes"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-language-property-codes</span><span>73-df-language-property-index-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-language-property-index-set — Nontrivial Language Property and Its Index Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"db96cabedd089e5f\" href=\"?note=db96cabedd089e5f\" title=\"73-df-binary-program-coding\">73-df-binary-program-coding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"888d8ab66ec7efca\" href=\"?note=888d8ab66ec7efca\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-semantics\">73-df-dtm-language-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"11b19b6d211be8ab\" href=\"?note=11b19b6d211be8ab\" title=\"73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages\">73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> (candidate class of binary Turing-recognizable languages)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span> (fixed coding package, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"db96cabedd089e5f\" href=\"?note=db96cabedd089e5f\" title=\"73-df-binary-program-coding\">73-df-binary-program-coding</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RE}_{\\mathbf 2}\">\\(\\mathsf{RE}_{\\mathbf 2}\\)</span> (recognizable binary languages, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"11b19b6d211be8ab\" href=\"?note=11b19b6d211be8ab\" title=\"73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages\">73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}language\\text{-}property\\text{-}index\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NontrivialLangProp}(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\varnothing\\neq\\mathcal C\\subsetneq\\mathsf{RE}_{\\mathbf 2}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}language\\text{-}property\\text{-}index\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NontrivialLangProp}(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\varnothing\\neq\\mathcal C\\subsetneq\\mathsf{RE}_{\\mathbf 2}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}language\\text{-}property\\text{-}index\\text{-}set}\\vdash\nI_{\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E}:\nM\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\land L(M)\\in\\mathcal C\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}language\\text{-}property\\text{-}index\\text{-}set}\\vdash\nI_{\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E}:\nM\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\land L(M)\\in\\mathcal C\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Because <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> is a class of languages rather than syntactic descriptions, membership is extensional by construction.</li>\n<li>Rice's theorem concerns decidability of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_{\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E}\">\\(I_{\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E}\\)</span>, not decidability of the class object <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> itself.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-binary-program-coding","status":"resolved","id":"db96cabedd089e5f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-program-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"888d8ab66ec7efca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages","status":"resolved","id":"11b19b6d211be8ab","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-program-coding","status":"resolved","id":"db96cabedd089e5f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ with $\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)$ (fixed coding package, see [[73-df-binary-program-coding]])","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages","status":"resolved","id":"11b19b6d211be8ab","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{RE}_{\\mathbf 2}$ (recognizable binary languages, see [[73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{RE}_{\\mathbf 2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}language\\text{-}property\\text{-}index\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NontrivialLangProp}(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\varnothing\\neq\\mathcal C\\subsetneq\\mathsf{RE}_{\\mathbf 2}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}language\\text{-}property\\text{-}index\\text{-}set}\\vdash\nI_{\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E}:\nM\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\land L(M)\\in\\mathcal C\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"I_{\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false}],"bytes":1531,"backlinks":[{"id":"1d543e6e6f293638","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{NontrivialLangProp}$ and $I_{\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E}$ (language properties and their index languages, see [[73-df-language-property-codes]])"}],"outgoing":["db96cabedd089e5f","888d8ab66ec7efca","11b19b6d211be8ab"]}